{title: Prepare the Way}
{subtitle: Matthew 3:1–12}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [F/A] | [Eb/G] [Eb] | [Bb] [F/A] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]In the wilderness of Judea [Eb]he appeared
[Gm7]Preaching repentance in [Eb]the open air
[Bb]The kingdom of heaven [Eb]has come near
A [Cm7]voice calling out, the world [Fsus4]draws near
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Prepare the [Bb]way of the [F/A]Lord
Make his [Gm7]paths straight for us to [Eb]see
The [Bb]spirit and the fire are [F/A]near
Repent now, [Eb]for the day is [Bb]here
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Camel hair and leather [Eb]was his dress
[Gm7]Locusts and honey, no [Eb]better rest
[Bb]Jerusalem and Judea [Eb]came
[Cm7]Baptized in Jordan, [F7sus4]naming their shame
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Prepare the [Bb]way of the [F/A]Lord
Make his [Gm]paths straight for us to [Eb]see
The [Bb]spirit and the fire are [F/A]near
Repent now, [Eb]for the day is [Bb]here
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Brood of vipers, [Eb]flee the coming wrath
[Gm]Produce fruit worthy of a [Eb]fresh start
[Bb]Abraham is not [Eb]a shield of pride
[Cm7]God can raise children [F7sus4]from stones inside
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Prepare the way [Bb]of the [F/A]Lord
Make his [Gm7]paths straight for us to [Eb]see
The [Bb]spirit and the fire are [F/A]near
Repent now, [Eb]for the day is [Bb]here
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Gm]I am not worthy to [Dm]carry his sandals
[Eb]He is mightier than I [Bb]can understand
[Gm]Water for repentance [Dm]is all I give
But the [Eb]Spirit and [F7sus4]Fire will [Bb]live
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Gather the wheat in[Eb]to the barn
[Gm]Burn the chaff with un[Eb]quenchable fire
[Bb]The way is prepared [Eb]
The Lord is [Bb]near
